// Uses processFile() for shared validation (extension + size)
// handleInputChange for file picker, handleDrop for drag-and-drop
// handleRemove clears staged file and resets input
// isDragging state with guard to avoid redundant setState on dragOver
// Early return renders staged file view when file is set
// Error strings derived from ALLOWED_EXTENSIONS constant
// accept attribute also derived from ALLOWED_EXTENSIONS

// Full component: 120 lines, 4 useState hooks, useRef for hidden input
// Handlers defined before early return
// formatFileSize helper: B/KB/MB formatting
