## Spec
- Drag-and-drop zone for single contract file
- File picker as alternative
- Accepted: .pdf, .txt, .doc, .docx — validated by extension
- Max 5 MB with error
- Feedback: name, size, remove/replace
- onFileChange callback for parent state
- File and instructions state are independent (instructions managed by parent)

